OL,3,AItaly says two citizens killed in
OL,4,AIranian strike in Kuwait
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Italian nationals have died after
OL,7,Fan Iranian strike on a facility in
OL,8,FKuwait, Italy's foreign ministry has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe pair were technicians working for
OL,12,FGerman arms manufacturing company
OL,13,FRheinmetall, the ministry added.
OL,15,FKuwait's defence ministry earlier said
OL,16,Fthat four people - the two Italians, a
OL,17,FKuwaiti national and Pakistani national
OL,18,F- had been injured from falling
OL,19,Fshrapnel after a number of drones from
OL,20,FIran were detected and intercepted.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
