OL,3,AItaly says two citizens killed in
OL,4,AIranian strike in Kuwait
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran has denied responsibility, with
OL,7,Farmed forces spokesperson Abolfazl
OL,8,FShekarchi saying "no military or
OL,9,Foffensive operations have been
OL,10,Fconducted" by its military.
